WEBVTT

01:43.950 --> 01:46.790
That's all I can do beforehand.

01:48.540 --> 01:52.880
What? But the booby traps should be enough to take out any YAKUZA.

01:52.880 --> 01:55.630
DŌMO, Y-C-N-A-N-SAN.

01:58.760 --> 02:01.890
Sucks for you, but we know all about your plan.

02:01.890 --> 02:03.970
<i>A NINJA? Why?</i>

02:04.390 --> 02:07.480
DŌMO. I am BASILISK.

02:07.480 --> 02:10.560
So you're NINJA Slayer's ACHILLES heel, huh?

02:07.480 --> 02:10.560
NOTE: A Greek NINJA, ACHILLES was famed for his indestructible magic heels.

02:10.560 --> 02:13.610
Let... Let me go!

02:13.610 --> 02:15.360
First, tell me your name.

02:15.360 --> 02:18.950
Even if you're a blonde, you should still know the rules of IKUSA.

02:22.080 --> 02:23.580
Such a strong will!

02:23.870 --> 02:29.040
I'm going to spend a whole day learning all the different ways you scream.

02:58.320 --> 03:01.610
There's no time to waste, BASILISK-SAN.

03:02.370 --> 03:06.990
Is that ugly body another joke of yours?

03:06.990 --> 03:10.710
I don't get many chances to take over a NINJA's body.

03:10.710 --> 03:15.630
Granted, that means this body's original owner wasn't very tough.

03:16.500 --> 03:19.260
Shall we question this woman?

03:19.260 --> 03:21.590
There's nothing we really want to know.

03:21.590 --> 03:22.640
So we kill her?

03:22.640 --> 03:26.760
No. She'll be useful somehow. Bind her.

03:27.720 --> 03:30.270
Look at me, woman!

03:31.390 --> 03:33.600
<i>M-My body...</i>

03:36.150 --> 03:37.980
I'll tell you how we pulled this off.

03:37.980 --> 03:42.820
We hacked NINJA Slayer's hideout.

03:42.820 --> 03:47.660
We're going to carry out your plan for you.

03:47.660 --> 03:50.790
Well, with a few slight changes.

03:50.790 --> 03:52.830
<i>What's going on?</i>

03:53.080 --> 03:58.500
Of course, NINJA Slayer-SAN will die there along with the boss.

03:58.500 --> 04:01.050
This is what they call "an ABU in the bush."

03:58.500 --> 04:01.050
NOTE: An ABU in the bush is worth .5 ABU in hand.

04:01.050 --> 04:04.220
<i>They're not with the SŌKAI SYNDICATE?</i>

04:04.220 --> 04:06.140
Do you understand?

04:06.140 --> 04:07.390
We're taking over.

04:07.390 --> 04:10.220
The boss was a wonderful leader,

04:10.220 --> 04:13.440
but one day I reached this conclusion.

04:13.440 --> 04:15.480
With my NINJA SOUL,

04:15.480 --> 04:19.480
I would get things done faster if I just took control of the SYNDICATE myself!

04:19.480 --> 04:21.190
So we can take it over!

04:21.190 --> 04:23.110
You and me!

04:23.110 --> 04:24.950
That's right!

04:24.950 --> 04:28.330
There're too many new faces in the SIX GATES these days.

04:28.330 --> 04:33.370
It's hard to keep the men loyal.

04:34.540 --> 04:36.330
Our buddies are here.

04:37.340 --> 04:38.920
How beautiful!

04:38.920 --> 04:42.170
You shall stay up here and watch with us.

04:42.170 --> 04:46.550
NINJA Slayer-SAN, the boss, and
Dark NINJA-SAN... All of them shall die!

04:46.550 --> 04:50.930
Then, you shall see a new order be born!

04:52.730 --> 04:55.650
<i>NINJA Slayer-SAN...</i>

05:00.230 --> 05:02.650
Open up, Maria!

05:02.650 --> 05:04.740
AIYEAGGH!

05:04.740 --> 05:06.070
Die, bitch!

05:06.410 --> 05:07.620
Die, bitch! Die, bitch! Die, bitch! Die, bitch! Die, bitch!

05:07.110 --> 05:08.240
AIYEAGGH! AIYEAGGH! AIYEAGGH! AIYEAGGH! AIYEAGGH!

05:12.870 --> 05:14.620
Die, bitch!

05:14.620 --> 05:15.790
AIYEAAAAAAGGH!

05:15.790 --> 05:17.120
Die!

05:18.210 --> 05:19.250
Who's there?

05:19.250 --> 05:21.630
DŌMO. Sushi delivery.

05:22.960 --> 05:23.970
Right.

05:23.760 --> 05:24.590
YEEART!

05:23.970 --> 05:26.300
ᗅᗷᗺᗅ!

05:29.640 --> 05:34.270
You're... Morita-SAN, from room 808?

05:34.270 --> 05:35.270
DŌMO.

05:35.940 --> 05:37.020
You bastard!

05:37.020 --> 05:39.900
You tryin' to butt into my family business?

05:40.360 --> 05:43.690
Should I not have done that, Agata-SAN?

05:43.690 --> 05:45.860
No. Thank you!

05:46.280 --> 05:47.610
Shall I remove him?

05:50.490 --> 05:51.240
Maria!

05:51.240 --> 05:52.740
YEEART!

05:54.250 --> 05:56.790
I am, in fact, Agata-SAN's neighbor.

05:56.790 --> 05:58.790
Promise you'll never come back.

05:58.790 --> 05:59.670
D-Don't kill me—

05:59.670 --> 06:00.080
YEEART!

06:00.080 --> 06:01.540
ᗅᗷᗺᗅ!

06:01.540 --> 06:03.130
Promise me!

06:03.130 --> 06:04.920
O-Okay! Just don't—

06:04.920 --> 06:05.510
YEEART!

06:05.510 --> 06:07.050
AIYEAGGH!

06:07.380 --> 06:09.140
AIYEAGGH! A-AIYEAGGH!

06:09.140 --> 06:12.850
AIYEAAAAGGGGHHHhhhh...

06:12.850 --> 06:15.220
I'll make sure you never forget this.

06:15.220 --> 06:18.690
AIYEAAAGGGHHH—

06:23.820 --> 06:26.400
Aiy... yeaggh...

06:28.240 --> 06:30.070
I will pay for the broken glass.

06:33.490 --> 06:34.450
Um...

06:34.450 --> 06:37.250
I do not involve myself in others' private lives.

06:37.250 --> 06:38.620
SAYŌNARA.

06:45.050 --> 06:50.550
Please... It's pathetic, but I'm still scared.

07:03.770 --> 07:05.820
An order for Hamachi Powder...

07:05.820 --> 07:07.650
The signal from Nancy!

07:07.650 --> 07:12.990
"Tomorrow, 1 PM. Centaur Room,
GO-AISATSU-SAMA Life Insurance HQ, 5th floor."

07:13.280 --> 07:16.990
At last, tomorrow his long-planned attack on the boss of SŌKAIYA,

07:16.990 --> 07:20.410
Laomoto Khan, would begin!

07:26.710 --> 07:33.590
I expected we'd need another full fiscal quarter to pull that off.

07:35.640 --> 07:36.310
Yes, sir.

07:39.480 --> 07:45.360
This internal coup d'etat was like BOTAMACHI on a SHELF. Time is money!

07:39.480 --> 07:45.360
NOTE: A SHELF is a thin, horizontal slab used to support objects.

07:47.530 --> 07:48.280
Yes, sir.

07:52.410 --> 07:56.240
Oh? Is something worrying you?

07:56.740 --> 07:57.740
Yes, sir.

07:58.540 --> 08:00.000
The way the wind blows...

08:00.000 --> 08:01.710
A poet!

08:03.670 --> 08:07.380
But your poetry skills are not to be underestimated,

08:07.590 --> 08:09.840
Dark NINJA-SAN.

08:13.090 --> 08:16.550
This is GO-AISATSU-SAMA Life Insurance HQ.

08:17.050 --> 08:19.560
And this is its lobby.

08:22.390 --> 08:24.520
This is NINJA Slayer in disguise!

08:28.150 --> 08:31.320
Welcome. I've been informed.

08:31.320 --> 08:32.950
Come this way.

08:54.090 --> 08:55.340
FUMN!

08:55.560 --> 08:58.010
Fuyuko... Tochinoki...

08:58.010 --> 09:00.430
It's almost time for VENGEANCE!

09:10.110 --> 09:11.070
He's alone?

09:17.530 --> 09:19.450
This Laomoto was a dummy!

09:19.450 --> 09:22.160
A dummy booby-trapped with a bomb!

09:23.250 --> 09:24.160
YEEART!

09:32.510 --> 09:36.550
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-san.
I am WIRED.

09:36.840 --> 09:40.510
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-san.
I am 10-COUNT.

09:40.890 --> 09:44.270
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-san.
I am BEEHIVE.

09:44.270 --> 09:45.520
DŌMO. I am NIN—

09:45.520 --> 09:46.350
GOTCHA!

09:47.310 --> 09:48.100
GWARGH!

09:48.100 --> 09:51.770
BEEHIVE fired his Gatling gun before NINJA Slayer finished his bow!

09:51.770 --> 09:54.530
An unspeakably SHITSUREI act!

09:51.770 --> 09:54.530
NOTE: SHITSUREI deeds are impure and taboo to NINJA.

09:54.530 --> 09:57.950
My ambush will turn you into NEGITORO PASTE!

09:57.950 --> 09:59.030
YEEART!

10:01.910 --> 10:05.750
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.
I am ALBATROSS.

10:05.750 --> 10:10.380
YEEART!

10:06.790 --> 10:09.750
To attack without returning the AISATSU is also SHITSUREI!

10:10.380 --> 10:12.040
I'm not done yet!

10:12.040 --> 10:13.880
YEEART! YEEART!

10:15.460 --> 10:16.130
YEEART!

10:17.300 --> 10:21.470
YEEART! YEEART! YEEART!

10:22.260 --> 10:23.600
YEEART!

10:25.890 --> 10:26.520
What?

10:27.350 --> 10:30.480
Metal is helpless before my MAGNET JUTSU!

10:36.490 --> 10:38.200
YEEART! YEEART!

10:38.200 --> 10:39.660
YEEART!

10:39.990 --> 10:41.990
A mistake! Follow him!

10:41.990 --> 10:42.780
With pleasure!

10:42.780 --> 10:43.740
YEEART!

10:43.740 --> 10:45.290
Get him!

10:47.370 --> 10:49.460
Where is he? Where did he go?

10:49.460 --> 10:50.670
Where are you?

10:50.670 --> 10:52.170
Where did you go?

10:52.500 --> 10:55.840
How did Laomoto find out about my assassination plan?

10:55.840 --> 10:57.590
Did Nancy-SAN betray me?

10:57.590 --> 11:00.220
Where are you? Where are you?

11:00.220 --> 11:01.930
Where did you go?

11:01.930 --> 11:05.510
No. She would never betray me.

11:05.510 --> 11:06.600
Which means...

11:06.600 --> 11:09.560
Where'd you go? Where are you?

11:09.560 --> 11:14.400
But first, I shall show them true NINJA IKUSA.

11:17.780 --> 11:20.820
You're NINJA Slayer-SAN!

11:20.820 --> 11:22.870
GUWAAARGH!

11:30.000 --> 11:34.420
<i>Did the four who were supposed to attack Dark NINJA-SAN pull it off?</i>

11:36.670 --> 11:41.720
<i>We lost WIRED-SAN and 10-COUNT-SAN,
and probably BEEHIVE-SAN, too.</i>

11:41.720 --> 11:44.800
DŌMO. I am NINJA Slayer.

11:44.800 --> 11:46.350
AIYEAGGH!

11:46.350 --> 11:48.890
DŌMO. I am ALBATROSS.

11:48.890 --> 11:50.020
How did you find me?

11:50.020 --> 11:51.600
By inference.

11:51.940 --> 11:54.230
I can't win! He'll kill me!

11:54.230 --> 11:56.270
I need to at least land a blow before I die...

11:56.690 --> 11:57.690
YEEART!

11:59.070 --> 12:00.110
AIYEAGGH!

12:00.490 --> 12:01.030
GWARGH!

12:04.950 --> 12:07.950
YEEEAAAAAAAARRRRRRT!

12:04.950 --> 12:07.950
GWAAAAAAAAAAAAARGH!

12:13.250 --> 12:15.670
AIYEAAAAAGGGGHH!

12:15.670 --> 12:18.420
Now, I will interrogate you.

12:18.420 --> 12:23.930
AIYEEEEEEAAAAAAGGGGGGGHHHHHH!
